  {
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Records retention could not reclaim",
   "description": "Records old enough to delete that a guard window still covers. remedik refuses to delete them because that record is the reason it will decline to act again. A number that stays high means the retention configured is shorter than the longest guard window, so it is not the retention actually in force.",
